WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.020 --> 01:47.760
=Episode 19=

01:47.780 --> 01:55.980
(Congratulations to Ye Feng
and Ling Yi on their marriage)

01:55.980 --> 01:58.420
(Double Happiness)
(Comrade Ye Feng, Comrade Ling Yi)

02:54.240 --> 02:54.640
Fang!

02:54.830 --> 02:55.915
Let's grab some food.

02:56.439 --> 02:57.320
I'll pass.

02:57.390 --> 02:58.626
My wife's bringing me lunch.

02:59.040 --> 03:00.040
Lucky you.

03:00.960 --> 03:01.839
Wait for me, Ji.

03:21.800 --> 03:22.640
You're here.

03:23.119 --> 03:24.040
You scared me.

03:24.040 --> 03:25.760
How did you know it was me?

03:26.520 --> 03:28.080
You have a special scent.

03:28.439 --> 03:29.439
Only I can smell it.

03:30.119 --> 03:31.040
It's uniquely yours.

03:31.960 --> 03:33.240
What are you, a bloodhound?

03:33.240 --> 03:34.360
Then smell this.

03:34.693 --> 03:35.515
I made it for you.

03:35.582 --> 03:36.404
What dish is it?

03:37.240 --> 03:38.360
Bok choy with pork lard.

03:38.839 --> 03:39.960
Impressive.

03:40.760 --> 03:41.599
Go on, try it.

03:46.559 --> 03:48.760
This is my first time
at your newspaper office.

03:52.999 --> 03:54.240
Smells like ink everywhere.

03:55.839 --> 03:56.640
So nice.

03:58.640 --> 04:01.399
If I go to college and graduate,

04:01.520 --> 04:03.200
could I become an editor, too?

04:03.640 --> 04:04.760
You already could.

04:05.640 --> 04:06.719
Honestly, in our paper,

04:06.719 --> 04:07.829
some of the editors

04:07.830 --> 04:08.848
aren't as good as you.

04:09.040 --> 04:10.559
I'll take that as encouragement.

04:20.359 --> 04:21.839
If I could have my name

04:21.839 --> 04:23.399
in the paper,

04:23.680 --> 04:24.640
I'd put it right here.

04:24.760 --> 04:26.399
"Written by Fei Ni."

04:27.039 --> 04:29.159
You might get your chance.
I heard from Uncle Fu

04:29.320 --> 04:31.560
the paper's launching
a writing contest soon.

04:31.839 --> 04:33.839
The theme is
the scenery of Jiangcheng.

04:33.919 --> 04:34.839
Why not give it a try?

04:34.839 --> 04:35.719
The winners

04:36.000 --> 04:36.909
will be published

04:36.910 --> 04:38.493
in the literary section
of the paper.

04:39.839 --> 04:40.399
Really?

04:40.399 --> 04:41.080
Yeah.

04:41.470 --> 04:43.404
The announcement should be
in the paper soon.

04:44.839 --> 04:46.760
I've been thinking lately.

04:47.039 --> 04:49.349
The factory might not
assign me a spot

04:49.350 --> 04:51.537
at Worker-Peasant-Soldier
University this summer.

04:51.560 --> 04:53.960
But if I win this contest,

04:54.399 --> 04:57.560
I'll have a better shot
at getting nominated.

05:00.320 --> 05:02.200
I think you're
getting ahead of yourself.

05:03.039 --> 05:05.640
Focus. Take your time
and write a good piece first.

05:06.039 --> 05:07.279
As for the outcome...

05:07.279 --> 05:08.399
Leave it to fate.

05:08.640 --> 05:10.239
No effort ever goes to waste.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.359
Eat up.

05:14.320 --> 05:16.560
I added extra pork lard. Try it.

05:24.760 --> 05:25.760
It's delicious.

05:25.839 --> 05:26.440
You eat.

05:26.560 --> 05:27.448
Have another bite.

05:53.799 --> 05:55.000
Chief Wang, I'll get going now.

05:55.000 --> 05:55.799
Thanks.

05:57.399 --> 06:00.479
These are last year's records from
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory,

06:00.599 --> 06:03.470
documenting outstanding
workers from each workshop.

06:03.471 --> 06:05.230
The factory leadership
has instructed us

06:05.320 --> 06:07.599
to compile
their stories into a booklet

06:07.599 --> 06:09.919
for publicity and promotion.

06:10.000 --> 06:11.269
Split them among yourselves.

06:11.270 --> 06:12.715
I want them
by the end of the week.

06:12.804 --> 06:13.640
- Okay.
- Okay.

06:17.910 --> 06:18.848
What's wrong, Fei Ting?

06:18.960 --> 06:19.760
This...

06:20.799 --> 06:23.919
There's no way I can even
get through all this in a week.

06:25.599 --> 06:26.760
How about I help you write it?

06:27.599 --> 06:28.159
No need.

06:28.680 --> 06:29.239
It's fine.

06:29.799 --> 06:31.120
I was just saying.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.399
It's all vegetables.

07:10.039 --> 07:10.719
You eat.

07:10.719 --> 07:11.799
What are you doing?

07:11.799 --> 07:13.239
Come on, keep some for yourself.

07:13.239 --> 07:14.200
I've got enough.

07:17.039 --> 07:17.560
Ni.

07:19.000 --> 07:21.799
I know you've been busy with work.

07:23.799 --> 07:25.239
But I'm really out of options.

07:26.799 --> 07:27.599
What happened?

07:28.182 --> 07:30.350
The Publicity Division wants me
to write profiles

07:30.359 --> 07:31.239
on model workers.

07:31.520 --> 07:33.239
I can't get a single word out.

07:34.120 --> 07:34.919
So,

07:35.560 --> 07:37.039
could you help me write one more?

07:40.799 --> 07:41.599
Listen.

07:41.799 --> 07:43.159
I'll be honest with you.

07:43.399 --> 07:45.399
I've got a piece
I can't seem to finish either.

07:45.760 --> 07:48.239
But if we really think it through,

07:48.239 --> 07:50.159
there's always a way.

07:50.640 --> 07:51.919
If you're really stuck,

07:51.919 --> 07:53.399
buy a copy of Jiangcheng Daily.

07:53.399 --> 07:55.239
They publish plenty
of model worker stories.

07:55.239 --> 07:56.320
Read them every day.

07:56.399 --> 07:58.799
You'll pick up
the writing style in no time.

08:00.560 --> 08:03.039
You're going to be
in the Publicity Division for a while.

08:03.093 --> 08:04.782
You'll have to learn sooner or later.

08:08.239 --> 08:09.200
Alright.

08:28.399 --> 08:29.640
You've been at it for an hour.

08:30.560 --> 08:31.640
Any inspiration?

08:34.960 --> 08:35.800
Fang Muyang,

08:36.239 --> 08:37.519
tell me,

08:38.519 --> 08:41.759
what if the scenery of Jiangcheng isn't
really about scenery at all?

08:44.239 --> 08:46.119
That's an interesting angle.

08:46.639 --> 08:47.440
If it's not scenery,

08:48.200 --> 08:49.200
then what is it?

08:49.639 --> 08:50.639
No clue yet.

08:50.639 --> 08:52.239
It's still just a thought.

08:54.040 --> 08:55.639
I just don't want to go off topic

08:55.960 --> 08:57.040
and lose my chance.

09:00.800 --> 09:01.200
Fei Ni.

09:01.479 --> 09:01.920
Yeah?

09:02.599 --> 09:04.440
There's a movement in Western painting

09:04.440 --> 09:05.359
called Impressionism.

09:05.800 --> 09:07.359
When it first appeared,

09:07.519 --> 09:09.320
the mainstream art world mocked it.

09:09.920 --> 09:10.920
They said

09:11.280 --> 09:12.400
it was too rough,

09:12.920 --> 09:13.719
too casual,

09:14.239 --> 09:15.359
like something

09:15.599 --> 09:17.359
painted from memory without care.

09:17.800 --> 09:18.599
But later,

09:18.999 --> 09:19.800
Impressionism

09:20.160 --> 09:21.599
became a groundbreaking force

09:22.280 --> 09:23.400
in Western art history.

09:24.719 --> 09:28.560
So you're saying literature,
like painting,

09:29.160 --> 09:30.239
needs innovation?

09:31.160 --> 09:33.071
I think whether
it's literature or painting,

09:33.639 --> 09:35.800
what matters is
expressing your true self.

09:36.239 --> 09:38.639
Every work should
carry the creator's unique imprint.

09:38.920 --> 09:39.599
Write in a way

09:39.599 --> 09:40.960
that truly represents you.

09:45.680 --> 09:47.160
I know what I'm going to write now.

09:51.540 --> 09:55.900
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

09:58.580 --> 10:03.180
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

10:03.200 --> 10:04.759
Another black-out?

10:05.239 --> 10:06.080
Ms. Liu?

10:06.639 --> 10:07.479
Ms. Liu?

10:08.519 --> 10:09.320
Do you have candles?

10:09.639 --> 10:10.759
I need to borrow a few.

10:11.400 --> 10:12.879
Sure, I'll drop by later.

10:12.879 --> 10:17.300
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

10:19.900 --> 10:24.300
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

10:26.980 --> 10:31.300
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

10:33.900 --> 10:40.180
♪The fallen leaves in autumn,
you belong to me♪

10:40.540 --> 10:43.860
♪When the world is covered in snow♪

10:44.180 --> 10:48.580
♪I still think of you♪

10:50.940 --> 10:56.740
♪There's a small place♪

10:58.100 --> 11:03.700
♪Where everyone has big dreams♪

11:05.100 --> 11:11.820
♪Every cute face♪

11:11.820 --> 11:18.260
♪Glows from the heart♪

11:19.500 --> 11:24.900
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

11:26.300 --> 11:32.220
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

11:33.380 --> 11:40.100
♪You belong to me, you see the light♪

11:40.380 --> 11:44.140
♪Remember, that's me♪

11:46.200 --> 11:47.239
Here, there's soup, too.

11:47.280 --> 11:47.999
Okay.

11:47.999 --> 11:49.590
Careful, it's hot.
Dinner's ready, Mom, Dad.

11:49.599 --> 11:50.639
- Sit here.
- Come on.

11:51.239 --> 11:52.400
I haven't heard anything about

11:52.400 --> 11:53.920
the factory ramping up production.

11:53.960 --> 11:55.440
Why is Fei Ting working overtime?

11:55.639 --> 11:58.639
They've been running a model worker

11:58.639 --> 11:59.639
publicity campaign.

11:59.639 --> 12:00.960
The Publicity Division's swamped.

12:01.599 --> 12:03.119
He can't work late every single day.

12:03.119 --> 12:05.999
If they're asking him to stay late,
it means they value him.

12:06.599 --> 12:08.160
Don't go talking nonsense outside.

12:08.599 --> 12:10.239
What if it gets back to Chief Wang?

12:10.239 --> 12:11.040
Then what?

12:11.040 --> 12:12.137
It'll affect his career.

12:12.400 --> 12:13.759
I'm not stupid.

12:13.759 --> 12:14.719
You never know.

12:17.440 --> 12:18.999
Did you save some food for Fei Ting?

12:19.093 --> 12:20.440
He'll be starving when he's back.

12:20.519 --> 12:22.599
Don't worry, Mom.
It's all kept warm in the pot.

12:24.280 --> 12:26.040
You really do dote on our son.

12:28.999 --> 12:31.599
So what exactly is Fei Ting writing?

12:31.839 --> 12:34.040
Just model worker stories.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.320
Is he any good?

12:36.400 --> 12:37.599
He's great.

12:37.599 --> 12:38.839
The leadership loves his work.

12:38.839 --> 12:41.519
They even broadcast it
over the factory loudspeakers.

12:41.960 --> 12:42.440
Really?

12:42.440 --> 12:42.800
Yeah.

12:43.040 --> 12:44.440
Looks like Ni taught him well.

12:45.400 --> 12:46.160
Mom, Dad,

12:46.320 --> 12:47.800
at the factory now,

12:47.999 --> 12:48.999
people address him

12:48.999 --> 12:51.560
as Officer Fei!

12:51.920 --> 12:53.119
He even showed me at home.

12:53.119 --> 12:54.239
He's so proud of himself.

12:54.239 --> 12:57.119
They all say, "If you need anything,
go to Officer Fei."

12:57.239 --> 12:57.879
Really?

12:58.440 --> 13:00.479
"If you need anything,
go to Officer Fei."

13:29.580 --> 13:33.100
(What to write?)

13:33.260 --> 13:35.940
(Jiangcheng People's Publishing House,
Jiangcheng Daily)

13:44.639 --> 13:46.960
Editor Liao, this is
the revised draft you asked for.

13:47.800 --> 13:48.599
Fang,

13:49.040 --> 13:50.719
I told you last time.

13:51.239 --> 13:52.560
With a comic strip,

13:52.839 --> 13:54.119
folks must be able follow it.

13:54.400 --> 13:55.629
Make it realistic.

13:55.630 --> 13:56.804
Highlight the main character.

13:56.871 --> 13:57.800
Look at this.

13:57.960 --> 13:58.599
It's crowded.

13:58.599 --> 14:00.040
Who's the main character here?

14:01.639 --> 14:02.440
Mr. Yuan,

14:03.040 --> 14:03.800
it's an idea.

14:03.800 --> 14:04.599
Hear me out.

14:05.040 --> 14:07.599
A comic strip is
about storytelling, yes.

14:08.160 --> 14:09.119
But I think

14:09.119 --> 14:11.239
different stories should
have different visual styles.

14:11.239 --> 14:12.280
Alright, alright.

14:12.639 --> 14:14.200
Don't lecture me.

14:14.440 --> 14:15.359
I wrote the story.

14:15.359 --> 14:16.359
It's my comic.

14:16.519 --> 14:18.040
Just draw it the way I told you.

14:18.680 --> 14:19.879
I picked you

14:20.239 --> 14:21.560
because your basics are solid

14:21.560 --> 14:22.293
and you're sharp.

14:22.293 --> 14:24.093
I thought we'd have
a first draft in a month.

14:24.093 --> 14:25.280
But look at this now.

14:33.239 --> 14:33.759
Mr. Yuan,

14:35.040 --> 14:36.200
I'll revise it your way.

14:37.040 --> 14:38.280
Please give me some time.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.239
Fine.

14:45.040 --> 14:46.280
For Fu's sake,

14:46.680 --> 14:47.693
I'll give you a chance.

14:48.200 --> 14:49.040
Thank you, Mr. Yuan.

14:50.350 --> 14:51.448
Do it properly this time.

14:52.040 --> 14:52.839
Good.

15:30.800 --> 15:31.800
Alright. Looks good.

15:32.040 --> 15:32.999
Run it like this.

15:33.359 --> 15:34.999
Okay. I'll get going, Editor Liao.

15:35.200 --> 15:35.719
Alright.

15:43.560 --> 15:44.999
That's how the world works.

15:45.440 --> 15:48.359
Not everyone who's famous deserves it,

15:48.680 --> 15:50.999
but they're the ones
holding the power and authority.

15:51.320 --> 15:52.999
All we can do is bow our heads.

15:53.879 --> 15:56.359
I don't care
who holds the authority.

15:56.960 --> 15:59.200
I just focus on drawing my best.

15:59.680 --> 16:01.119
Knowing you,

16:01.119 --> 16:03.080
I thought you'd refuse Mr. Yuan

16:03.080 --> 16:04.119
and keep your version.

16:04.960 --> 16:06.119
I wanted to.

16:07.160 --> 16:08.599
But I have a family now.

16:09.479 --> 16:11.040
And he pays well.

16:12.239 --> 16:13.320
Fang Muyang,

16:14.440 --> 16:15.280
you've changed.

16:16.359 --> 16:17.280
I have.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.400
And for the better.

16:21.359 --> 16:22.160
Fang Muyang!

16:23.560 --> 16:24.280
Fei Ni.

16:32.048 --> 16:33.320
What's Ling Yi doing here?

16:33.719 --> 16:35.160
She's an intern at the paper.

16:35.160 --> 16:36.182
Comes in twice a week.

16:36.471 --> 16:37.560
What brings you here?

16:37.680 --> 16:38.719
I came to pick you up.

16:39.239 --> 16:40.040
Really?

16:41.320 --> 16:43.320
Or are you here
to ask about the article?

16:43.471 --> 16:44.330
I can check for you.

16:44.330 --> 16:46.119
No, don't do it.

16:46.320 --> 16:48.280
That wouldn't be fair to the others.

16:48.759 --> 16:49.759
Win or lose,

16:49.759 --> 16:51.599
I want a clear conscience.

16:53.360 --> 16:54.630
I'm just here to take you home.

16:54.639 --> 16:55.239
Let's go.

16:55.239 --> 16:56.599
Yeah. Let's head home.

17:02.080 --> 17:02.879
Hey.

17:04.559 --> 17:05.479
You're back.

17:06.840 --> 17:08.319
What are you doing here?

17:08.360 --> 17:09.239
Something at home?

17:10.160 --> 17:10.960
No.

17:12.319 --> 17:15.680
I need to talk to Fang Muyang
about something.

17:17.160 --> 17:17.920
Let's go upstairs.

17:17.920 --> 17:18.759
Stay for dinner.

17:18.759 --> 17:19.400
No, no.

17:19.880 --> 17:20.519
You and I...

17:21.360 --> 17:22.239
Let's talk outside.

17:25.279 --> 17:26.319
So mysterious?

17:26.719 --> 17:28.319
Alright, you two talk.

17:28.319 --> 17:29.559
I'll head in.

17:31.840 --> 17:32.640
Get on.

17:36.519 --> 17:37.319
Where to?

17:37.440 --> 17:39.440
Just start riding.

17:47.360 --> 17:48.160
Hey.

17:48.559 --> 17:49.799
Dragging me out here

17:50.279 --> 17:51.479
is making me nervous.

17:52.640 --> 17:53.759
Did you bring a cleaver?

17:55.880 --> 17:58.279
Back then, that was a misunderstanding.

17:58.337 --> 17:59.671
If I'd known you were this good,

17:59.715 --> 18:01.230
I would've married Ni to you sooner.

18:05.799 --> 18:08.319
What's wrong? Trouble at work?

18:08.960 --> 18:09.920
Trouble?

18:11.039 --> 18:12.039
It's driving me insane.

18:15.680 --> 18:16.799
You can't tell anyone.

18:17.319 --> 18:19.360
I promise. Not even Fei Ni.

18:21.160 --> 18:21.920
Honestly,

18:22.093 --> 18:24.071
I've thought about this for a long time.

18:24.759 --> 18:26.960
I really don't know who else to talk to.

18:28.160 --> 18:30.360
After going over it
again and again, it's only you.

18:31.039 --> 18:33.039
After all, I got this job

18:33.039 --> 18:35.160
because you and Fei Ni
helped me secure it.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.160
So it is about work?

18:38.920 --> 18:39.759
No.

18:40.440 --> 18:41.920
The job itself is fine.

18:42.920 --> 18:43.759
It's me.

18:46.715 --> 18:48.310
Every day in the Publicity Division

18:48.840 --> 18:50.880
feels like I'm serving time.

18:51.079 --> 18:51.920
I really don't know

18:52.960 --> 18:53.920
how to do anything.

18:57.360 --> 18:58.160
Hey,

18:58.759 --> 18:59.920
don't say that.

19:00.840 --> 19:02.160
Everyone has strengths

19:02.160 --> 19:03.079
and weaknesses.

19:03.920 --> 19:05.360
Maybe you're not great at writing,

19:05.519 --> 19:06.880
but you're excellent in the fields.

19:07.279 --> 19:09.160
And when we did carpentry together,

19:09.279 --> 19:10.640
you were pretty good at that, too.

19:11.160 --> 19:12.360
And your cooking, too.

19:13.759 --> 19:15.239
How can you say you can't do anything?

19:16.319 --> 19:17.120
I don't know.

19:18.319 --> 19:20.360
Back in Great Northern Wilderness,

19:21.360 --> 19:23.319
I really felt like
I could handle anything.

19:23.826 --> 19:25.230
I had so much drive every day.

19:26.479 --> 19:27.960
But ever since returning to the city,

19:28.279 --> 19:29.559
nothing feels right.

19:30.079 --> 19:31.840
Whatever I do, I mess it up.

19:33.737 --> 19:36.626
Sometimes, I think I should've just
stayed in Great Northern Wilderness.

19:39.319 --> 19:40.160
Ting,

19:40.880 --> 19:42.160
you've seen screws before, right?

19:44.039 --> 19:45.319
Look at a screw.

19:45.671 --> 19:46.960
Some are long, some are short.

19:47.079 --> 19:49.360
You can't use a short one to fix a sofa.

19:49.759 --> 19:50.920
But it's perfect for a stool.

19:50.982 --> 19:52.270
A long one wouldn't work there.

19:53.880 --> 19:56.360
That's putting things to their best use.

19:57.039 --> 19:57.840
I think

19:58.319 --> 19:59.279
people only

19:59.279 --> 20:00.519
reach their full potential

20:01.239 --> 20:02.719
when they're in the right role.

20:03.559 --> 20:05.239
If this job isn't right for you,

20:06.048 --> 20:07.310
maybe think about switching.

20:08.559 --> 20:09.640
How could I?

20:10.440 --> 20:11.319
Forget Ni,

20:11.319 --> 20:12.559
Lin Mei would never agree.

20:12.920 --> 20:15.039
And jobs aren't easy to find right now.

20:15.279 --> 20:17.160
It's not like I can just switch.

20:17.559 --> 20:19.079
I'm not saying quit tomorrow.

20:19.680 --> 20:21.319
But you can start thinking about it.

20:21.360 --> 20:23.120
Figure out what you're good at.

20:23.519 --> 20:24.440
As for the rest,

20:25.319 --> 20:26.440
take it step by step.

20:40.671 --> 20:43.471
(Jiangcheng Daily)

21:08.759 --> 21:10.079
Is that today's?

21:10.479 --> 21:11.680
See for yourself.

21:18.559 --> 21:21.360
Everyone carries their own
most beautiful scenery.

21:21.559 --> 21:23.360
For some,
it's in the mountains and rivers.

21:23.559 --> 21:25.440
For others,
it's in the passing seasons.

21:26.920 --> 21:27.759
Fang Muyang!

21:27.880 --> 21:28.440
My article!

21:28.440 --> 21:29.920
My article's in the paper!

21:29.920 --> 21:31.559
It's in the paper!

21:31.559 --> 21:33.239
You won! Your article won!

21:35.680 --> 21:36.960
The teacher's guidance...

21:51.239 --> 21:52.079
What's wrong?

21:58.640 --> 21:59.559
The author

22:01.039 --> 22:01.920
is not me.

22:04.740 --> 22:08.460
(Written by Ling Yi)

22:21.848 --> 22:23.160
Here's the original submission.

22:23.319 --> 22:24.039
Take a look.

22:34.519 --> 22:36.039
This is exactly what I wrote.

22:36.239 --> 22:37.880
Are you implying

22:38.239 --> 22:39.519
that Ling Yi plagiarized you?

22:40.400 --> 22:41.920
Careful with that accusation.

22:42.479 --> 22:43.279
Editor Liao,

22:43.880 --> 22:45.759
could you find Fei Ni's submission?

22:45.920 --> 22:46.999
We can compare them.

22:47.279 --> 22:48.960
Fei Ni?

22:49.239 --> 22:51.239
I don't recall that name at all.

22:53.559 --> 22:54.120
Alright.

22:54.479 --> 22:56.120
All the submissions are over there.

22:56.319 --> 22:57.360
You can look through them.

22:57.880 --> 22:58.319
Okay.

23:06.260 --> 23:11.580
(Submitted by: Ling Yi)

23:22.900 --> 23:31.479
(Diagram of Pork Cuts)

23:31.479 --> 23:32.279
Fei Ting!

23:32.440 --> 23:33.239
Chief Wang.

23:33.239 --> 23:35.559
We asked you
to promote our model workers,

23:35.559 --> 23:36.559
but this whole piece

23:36.880 --> 23:39.079
has no real feeling,
no substance.

23:39.079 --> 23:40.160
This won't do!

23:40.640 --> 23:42.160
I'm sorry, Chief Wang.

23:42.360 --> 23:45.360
I'll rewrite it.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.880
That's what you said last week.

23:49.120 --> 23:50.960
And you're writing far too slowly.

23:51.519 --> 23:52.680
Everyone else is done.

23:52.680 --> 23:54.120
You're still two pieces short.

23:54.559 --> 23:55.319
Yes.

23:59.559 --> 24:00.640
If you're really stuck,

24:00.999 --> 24:02.200
have someone at home

24:02.880 --> 24:04.160
help you think it through.

25:13.559 --> 25:14.559
That's impossible.

25:14.759 --> 25:16.680
I put it in the mailbox myself.

25:17.239 --> 25:18.559
Could it have been lost?

25:21.120 --> 25:22.120
If it was lost,

25:22.759 --> 25:24.160
then what about Ling Yi's article?

25:30.680 --> 25:31.880
Ling's back.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.120
What a surprise.

25:50.840 --> 25:52.226
Looking for my mother-in-law?

25:52.239 --> 25:53.160
Why not go upstairs?

25:54.671 --> 25:56.404
(The Scenery of Jiangcheng)
What is this?

25:57.960 --> 25:58.880
What do you mean?

25:59.360 --> 26:01.440
I wrote this article.

26:01.840 --> 26:03.160
Why is your name on it?

26:06.479 --> 26:07.319
Fei Ni,

26:08.479 --> 26:10.319
you're saying I stole your piece?

26:11.680 --> 26:12.759
Do you have proof?

26:15.360 --> 26:16.920
If you don't,

26:17.039 --> 26:18.239
then that's slander.

26:18.239 --> 26:19.079
It's defamation.

26:19.759 --> 26:21.680
Maybe you write well,

26:21.715 --> 26:22.680
but that doesn't mean

26:22.680 --> 26:24.039
no one else could write

26:24.039 --> 26:25.640
something similar or even better.

26:26.160 --> 26:28.840
And the contest has its own procedures.

26:28.840 --> 26:30.039
I don't own the press.

26:30.039 --> 26:31.960
I can't just put my name on anything.

26:32.319 --> 26:33.759
If you keep making a scene,

26:33.880 --> 26:36.120
we can go upstairs
and ask Ms. Xu to judge.

26:41.319 --> 26:42.319
If that's all,

26:42.319 --> 26:43.279
I'm heading up.

26:43.559 --> 26:44.079
Ling Yi.

26:46.559 --> 26:47.479
I need a word.

26:53.239 --> 26:55.479
I read Fei Ni's article
before she submitted it.

26:56.279 --> 26:57.759
Even if you two had the same idea,

26:59.160 --> 27:00.719
it couldn't be this identical.

27:08.160 --> 27:09.039
I did it.

27:10.319 --> 27:11.640
But except in front of you,

27:11.759 --> 27:13.039
I will never admit it.

27:20.680 --> 27:22.079
What turned you into this?

27:24.640 --> 27:25.440
Yeah.

27:26.120 --> 27:27.479
How did I end up like this?

27:29.479 --> 27:31.960
(If I were still
that carefree girl from before,)

27:33.120 --> 27:35.840
(not feeding pigs
just to get a full meal,)

27:36.226 --> 27:38.039
(not living in fear of being bullied,)

27:38.040 --> 27:38.920
(on edge every day,)

27:39.319 --> 27:40.559
(not having to grovel)

27:40.559 --> 27:42.160
(just to stay in Jiangcheng...)

27:59.920 --> 28:01.079
Even if you suffered,

28:02.840 --> 28:03.960
you can't hurt someone else.

28:05.719 --> 28:06.719
I don't have that luxury.

28:08.319 --> 28:09.559
When you're barely surviving,

28:09.559 --> 28:11.079
giving it everything you've got,

28:11.160 --> 28:12.519
how do I care about others?

28:13.880 --> 28:15.279
To Fei Ni,

28:15.582 --> 28:17.070
this article is just a piece of candy.

28:17.519 --> 28:18.920
But to me, it's medicine.

28:19.093 --> 28:20.137
It's my bargaining chip

28:20.160 --> 28:21.920
to stay at the newspaper
after graduation.

28:22.759 --> 28:23.440
Fang Muyang,

28:24.559 --> 28:25.640
you helped me once.

28:25.640 --> 28:26.840
I'm grateful.

28:27.719 --> 28:29.680
So I promise you this.

28:30.120 --> 28:32.160
If I stay on after graduation,

28:32.319 --> 28:33.640
whenever Fei Ni wants to publish,

28:33.640 --> 28:34.689
I'll do everything I can.

28:34.690 --> 28:35.920
She doesn't need your help.

28:37.079 --> 28:38.079
If she gets published,

28:38.920 --> 28:40.120
it'll be on her own merit.

28:42.960 --> 28:44.279
I don't agree with what you did.

28:45.319 --> 28:47.160
I have to seek justice for her.

28:47.160 --> 28:48.840
And how exactly will you do that?

28:49.640 --> 28:50.440
Threaten me?

28:51.319 --> 28:53.239
If I don't admit to plagiarism,

28:53.640 --> 28:54.960
you'll tell everyone

28:54.960 --> 28:56.839
(how I tried to kill myself,
and you gave me)

28:56.840 --> 28:57.700
(the university spot?)

29:00.880 --> 29:03.200
Ling Yi, what are you doing?

29:03.880 --> 29:04.719
Get down.

29:05.840 --> 29:07.079
There's no hope anymore.

29:07.319 --> 29:10.719
I don't want to live like this!

29:11.160 --> 29:12.160
You do have hope.

29:12.160 --> 29:14.039
No, Fang Muyang!

29:14.400 --> 29:16.640
My mother is gone.

29:16.719 --> 29:19.079
There's nothing left for me.

29:19.319 --> 29:21.120
I'll give you my university spot.

29:23.719 --> 29:24.640
(We're not the same.)

29:26.559 --> 29:28.239
I won't turn
what I did for you back then

29:29.440 --> 29:30.960
into leverage against you now.

29:33.920 --> 29:34.719
Fang Muyang,

29:36.120 --> 29:37.160
I know you don't care.

29:37.680 --> 29:38.559
But I do.

29:39.759 --> 29:41.039
With this article,

29:41.120 --> 29:42.920
I've proven what I'm capable of.

29:43.759 --> 29:45.319
As for how I got into university,

29:46.239 --> 29:47.120
no one will care.

30:04.920 --> 30:05.840
What did she say?

30:09.719 --> 30:10.559
She admitted it.

30:16.020 --> 30:19.460
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

30:24.079 --> 30:25.719
Fei!

30:25.840 --> 30:26.559
Master Li.

30:30.120 --> 30:30.920
Got another job?

30:31.120 --> 30:33.160
Good pay, just bad timing.

30:33.440 --> 30:34.279
Friday afternoon.

30:35.120 --> 30:35.960
That won't work.

30:38.319 --> 30:39.479
I'm on shift Friday.

30:39.759 --> 30:41.479
Take a day off.

30:42.039 --> 30:42.840
Think about it.

30:43.120 --> 30:44.039
Your salary

30:44.239 --> 30:46.479
is barely one yuan a day.

30:46.840 --> 30:49.239
Half a day with me is
at least 3.5 yuan.

30:52.982 --> 30:54.120
It's not about the money.

30:54.279 --> 30:55.920
I'm making side cash during work hours.

30:55.920 --> 30:57.360
If Chief Wang finds out, I'm toast.

30:58.440 --> 31:00.160
Then don't let her find out.

31:00.960 --> 31:03.279
Everyone gets sick sometimes.

31:03.279 --> 31:05.440
Take sick leave.
She won't drag you to the hospital.

31:09.880 --> 31:10.680
Fei,

31:11.719 --> 31:12.640
listen closely.

31:14.079 --> 31:16.039
The factory turns a blind eye

31:16.079 --> 31:18.079
to this stuff.

31:18.440 --> 31:19.840
You think I'd dare otherwise?

31:20.360 --> 31:20.999
Besides,

31:21.319 --> 31:23.239
I picked you because you're honest

31:23.479 --> 31:24.640
and hardworking.

31:24.960 --> 31:26.319
That's why I'm offering you

31:26.319 --> 31:27.719
a job that offers

31:27.999 --> 31:29.759
good food, perks, and pay.

31:30.026 --> 31:31.804
I could grab anyone from the canteen,

31:31.960 --> 31:32.990
and they'd be grateful.

31:33.920 --> 31:34.640
Right?

31:38.039 --> 31:38.519
Alright.

31:39.759 --> 31:40.719
Friday afternoon, then.

31:40.719 --> 31:41.920
We'll go together. I'm off.

31:56.160 --> 31:58.519
The newspaper's trash is
dumped here every day.

31:59.200 --> 32:00.440
This bin here

32:00.880 --> 32:02.360
has no fixed clearing schedule.

32:03.239 --> 32:04.440
When things get busy,

32:04.804 --> 32:06.750
it might sit for ten days,
even half a month.

32:29.559 --> 32:30.519
(Uncle Fu,)

32:30.759 --> 32:32.559
(I'll be graduating in a year.)

32:32.920 --> 32:34.680
I'd like to hear your advice

32:34.680 --> 32:36.120
about my job placement.

32:36.319 --> 32:38.719
You've been interning
at the paper lately,

32:38.960 --> 32:40.559
and you've done quite well.

32:40.960 --> 32:42.120
But you know,

32:42.519 --> 32:46.319
positions at the paper are very limited.

32:46.759 --> 32:49.559
If you want to stay on,

32:49.759 --> 32:52.640
you'll need even stronger results.

32:53.440 --> 32:56.559
Your mother and I go way back,

32:56.960 --> 32:58.799
but we can't play favorites.

33:01.799 --> 33:02.559
(Ling Yi,)

33:02.719 --> 33:05.440
(help me sort
these submissions in a bit.)

33:05.640 --> 33:07.360
(File them by surname,
alphabetically.)

33:07.582 --> 33:08.750
(I'll check them tomorrow.)

33:09.079 --> 33:10.160
(Yes, Editor Liao.)

33:10.700 --> 33:12.100
(Submitted by: Ling Yi)

33:17.180 --> 33:20.780
(Jiangcheng Daily, mail from Fei Ni)

33:26.300 --> 33:28.940
(The Scenery of Jiangcheng)

34:43.180 --> 34:46.900
(Jiangcheng People's Publishing House,
Jiangcheng Daily)

34:46.900 --> 34:48.559
(The Scenery of Jiangcheng)

34:48.559 --> 34:49.240
Ling Yi,

34:49.760 --> 34:51.960
who actually wrote this article?

34:52.119 --> 34:54.039
I submitted it
through proper channels.

34:54.240 --> 34:55.760
Editor Liao reviewed it personally.

34:55.960 --> 34:58.320
If you don't believe me,
you can ask Editor Liao.

34:58.679 --> 35:00.159
As for Fei Ni's article,

35:00.280 --> 35:02.048
neither Editor Liao nor I have seen it.

35:04.280 --> 35:06.320
How can you prove you wrote it?

35:11.320 --> 35:12.159
President Fu,

35:12.519 --> 35:13.840
I know you've always admired

35:13.840 --> 35:14.999
Fang Muyang's talent.

35:15.360 --> 35:17.880
But that doesn't mean
everything he says is true,

35:17.960 --> 35:18.760
especially if

35:19.280 --> 35:20.840
he's been instigated.

35:25.920 --> 35:26.720
President Fu,

35:26.960 --> 35:28.079
Fang Muyang and I

35:28.079 --> 35:29.479
spent the whole night

35:29.559 --> 35:32.119
digging this out of the trash
on the first floor.

35:40.639 --> 35:42.760
Isn't this the same article
Ling Yi published?

35:43.160 --> 35:44.280
Whose handwriting is this?

35:44.280 --> 35:44.840
Mine.

35:45.519 --> 35:46.880
This article is mine.

35:47.360 --> 35:48.920
Someone tore it up

35:48.920 --> 35:50.320
and threw it in the trash.

35:50.559 --> 35:52.840
Then the byline was changed

35:53.079 --> 35:54.119
and it was published.

35:54.960 --> 35:55.440
Ling Yi,

35:56.760 --> 35:58.079
care to explain?

36:00.320 --> 36:01.039
That's impossible.

36:01.760 --> 36:03.840
Maybe she copied it herself

36:03.840 --> 36:05.159
and brought this to fool everyone.

36:05.826 --> 36:07.604
There's a postmark on the envelope.

36:07.840 --> 36:09.559
You can see when it was mailed.

36:10.240 --> 36:11.880
Shall I call in Editor Liao

36:12.119 --> 36:12.880
and ask him

36:13.360 --> 36:14.920
when he first saw your submission?

36:15.360 --> 36:16.039
That way,

36:16.039 --> 36:17.479
we'll know who came first.

36:19.280 --> 36:20.720
There is a postmark.

36:20.760 --> 36:21.760
It's fake!

36:22.920 --> 36:23.720
For Fang Muyang,

36:23.720 --> 36:24.960
forging a postmark is easy.

36:24.960 --> 36:26.079
On what grounds?

36:26.320 --> 36:27.039
Do you have proof?

36:27.039 --> 36:28.119
We found this envelope

36:28.119 --> 36:29.519
in the newspaper's trash!

36:29.519 --> 36:30.159
You're lying!

36:30.159 --> 36:31.559
I didn't throw it at the newspaper!

36:31.559 --> 36:32.360
I threw it...

36:48.320 --> 36:49.119
Ling Yi,

36:49.760 --> 36:52.119
you've deeply disappointed me.

36:53.519 --> 36:55.199
When you were little,

36:55.199 --> 36:57.119
you were a bit willful,

36:57.360 --> 36:59.360
but I believed your heart was good.

36:59.360 --> 37:01.920
I never imagined

37:02.320 --> 37:05.320
you would do something like this.

37:07.119 --> 37:08.960
Uncle Fu, hear me out.

37:08.960 --> 37:11.079
I lost my head.

37:12.039 --> 37:13.440
I wanted to stay so badly.

37:13.760 --> 37:16.079
I know you had high hopes for me

37:16.079 --> 37:17.720
because of my late mother.

37:17.720 --> 37:19.400
I was afraid that if I failed,

37:19.400 --> 37:20.920
I'd embarrass you.

37:20.920 --> 37:22.240
I just wanted to prove myself.

37:23.479 --> 37:24.840
I'm sorry, Uncle Fu.

37:25.760 --> 37:28.880
I'm not the one you owe an apology to.

37:33.920 --> 37:34.720
Fei Ni,

37:35.880 --> 37:37.760
I'm sorry. Please forgive me.

37:43.920 --> 37:44.720
Fei Ni,

37:45.360 --> 37:46.840
I will give you an explanation

37:46.999 --> 37:49.920
on this matter.

37:50.159 --> 37:51.320
I'll handle it right away.

37:51.519 --> 37:55.159
We'll publish
a correction notice tomorrow,

37:55.479 --> 37:57.479
and restore the byline to you.

38:06.840 --> 38:07.760
As for Ling Yi...

38:07.760 --> 38:08.639
Uncle Fu,

38:09.920 --> 38:10.720
I...

38:11.760 --> 38:13.479
I just want my name back.

38:14.240 --> 38:15.559
Thank you for this.

38:18.920 --> 38:19.720
Fang Muyang,

38:19.960 --> 38:20.639
let's go.

38:30.760 --> 38:31.559
Wait.

38:42.159 --> 38:43.119
Thank you.

38:45.679 --> 38:46.519
For what?

38:48.280 --> 38:50.760
For not pressing the issue further

38:50.760 --> 38:52.119
in front of President Fu.

38:56.119 --> 38:56.720
Ling Yi,

38:57.493 --> 38:58.840
I understand your situation.

38:59.479 --> 39:01.440
The first time
I went to Ms. Xu's house,

39:01.559 --> 39:03.039
she gave me a glass cup,

39:03.280 --> 39:04.639
and you a white porcelain one.

39:05.559 --> 39:07.960
In her eyes, I wasn't your equal.

39:08.559 --> 39:09.840
Now that I'm gone,

39:10.039 --> 39:11.360
you're the glass cup,

39:11.720 --> 39:13.320
and Ye Feng is the porcelain one.

39:14.559 --> 39:16.119
So I know why

39:16.119 --> 39:18.280
you're so desperate
to stay at the paper.

39:18.679 --> 39:19.199
Because

39:19.199 --> 39:21.240
it's your footing
and your dignity in the Xu family.

39:25.479 --> 39:26.119
Let's go.

39:41.039 --> 39:42.039
I didn't expect you

39:42.800 --> 39:44.119
to be so considerate of Ling Yi.

39:48.119 --> 39:50.119
I do understand why she did it.

39:50.559 --> 39:52.159
She just wanted to stay at the paper.

39:53.110 --> 39:54.782
I've felt that kind of pressure, too.

39:55.280 --> 39:58.320
Like when I took care of you
to get into college.

39:58.559 --> 39:59.360
It's the same.

40:02.320 --> 40:03.119
It's not.

40:04.479 --> 40:06.119
You helped me to help someone.

40:06.559 --> 40:07.880
She hurt someone.

40:09.760 --> 40:11.440
To be honest,
she wasn't always like this.

40:12.360 --> 40:14.840
I know. She's talented.

40:15.079 --> 40:16.119
And hardworking.

40:16.280 --> 40:17.559
She just hit a wall

40:17.559 --> 40:18.760
and took the wrong turn.

40:19.240 --> 40:20.720
If she relies on herself,

40:21.079 --> 40:22.119
she'll be fine.

40:28.599 --> 40:29.360
Fang Muyang...

40:32.119 --> 40:33.920
If you ever run into trouble,

40:34.280 --> 40:35.519
tell me.

40:36.039 --> 40:36.999
We'll face it together.

40:40.960 --> 40:41.519
Okay.

40:46.999 --> 40:47.360
Fei Ni!

40:47.360 --> 40:48.199
You're back!

40:48.320 --> 40:48.760
Fei Ni!

40:49.800 --> 40:50.400
Fei Ni!

40:51.639 --> 40:52.440
What is it, Ms. Liu?

40:52.440 --> 40:52.880
Look!

40:52.880 --> 40:53.760
Quick!

40:53.999 --> 40:56.280
Your article is in the paper!

40:59.404 --> 41:01.340
(Correction: The author's name of
"Scenery of Jiangcheng" was corrected.)

41:01.340 --> 41:02.360
(It is hereby credited to Fei Ni.)

41:04.679 --> 41:06.559
This is incredible, Fei Ni!

41:06.559 --> 41:08.199
Your name's in the paper!

41:08.199 --> 41:11.039
And you won first prize in the contest!

41:11.159 --> 41:11.999
Come take a look!

41:12.159 --> 41:14.280
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory
has a rising star!

41:14.479 --> 41:16.440
Fei Ni's article's in the paper!

41:16.440 --> 41:16.840
Come on!

41:16.840 --> 41:18.039
What's going on here?

41:18.039 --> 41:19.360
Chief Wang!

41:19.360 --> 41:20.079
Come look!

41:20.079 --> 41:20.880
Quick!

41:21.079 --> 41:23.119
Fei Ni's article made the paper!

41:25.479 --> 41:26.400
It really is.

41:26.400 --> 41:27.159
See?

41:27.226 --> 41:29.590
I've always said Fei Ni belongs
in the Publicity Division.

41:29.590 --> 41:30.515
With writing like that,

41:30.537 --> 41:31.893
no one in this factory can top her.

41:32.800 --> 41:33.639
Chief Wang,

41:34.400 --> 41:36.639
Fei Ni is the pride of Workshop One.

41:37.039 --> 41:38.999
You can't just poach our talent.

41:39.840 --> 41:41.639
It's just a hobby.

41:41.639 --> 41:42.280
Really,

41:42.280 --> 41:43.240
it's nothing.

41:43.240 --> 41:44.679
Oh, stop being modest.

41:44.760 --> 41:46.599
That blackboard paper
you did was excellent.

41:46.599 --> 41:48.280
Everyone saw it, right?

41:48.960 --> 41:50.679
Isn't that right, Wang?

41:51.240 --> 41:53.599
Tell Master Li to add
two extra dishes today.

41:53.639 --> 41:54.760
Master Li took a sick leave.

41:54.760 --> 41:55.440
He just left.

41:56.880 --> 41:57.679
That's fine.

41:58.079 --> 42:00.440
Fei Ni, lunch is on me today.

42:03.679 --> 42:04.559
Fei Ni, come here.

42:08.679 --> 42:09.760
Listen,

42:10.070 --> 42:11.419
you need to help your brother.

42:11.420 --> 42:14.360
Not finishing the articles made him
so stressed that he took a sick leave.

42:14.382 --> 42:15.160
You promised me...

42:15.999 --> 42:17.240
Comrade Feng Lin,

42:17.599 --> 42:18.360
done with lunch?

42:26.400 --> 42:27.880
You assured me

42:27.880 --> 42:29.440
your brother would be fine.

42:29.440 --> 42:30.320
Now there's a problem.

42:30.639 --> 42:32.079
You need to take responsibility.

42:32.280 --> 42:33.079
If this keeps up,

42:33.079 --> 42:34.360
I can't answer for it.

42:34.639 --> 42:35.880
Don't worry, Chief Wang.

42:35.960 --> 42:38.119
I'll handle his drafts from now on.

42:39.639 --> 42:41.400
Alright, alright.

42:41.679 --> 42:42.360
Let's eat.

42:42.360 --> 42:42.639
Okay.

42:42.639 --> 42:43.280
Come on.

42:53.760 --> 42:54.880
Ms. Feng, finished eating?

43:05.079 --> 43:06.720
Why are those two together?

43:07.920 --> 43:09.240
Weren't they both on sick leave?

43:11.079 --> 43:13.039
They don't look sick to me.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
